  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3c9388786e060247b66d65ff980bad6, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1. Tabby
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: First, you take the leaves of the stem...
  - Dialogue: Then you braid the second flower stem around the first...
  - Dialogue: And continue adding 'til you have a chain that can wrap around your
      head..
  - Dialogue: And finally you braid the final flower back into the first flower to
      make a crown...
  - Dialogue: And ta-da!
  - Dialogue: You have a pretty flower crown!
